                                                                 <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/core/meta/AnnotationVocabulary/usageNote> "For annotations, see the inverse relation 'has activity profile'." .


###  http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/lis14/rdl/after
<http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/lis14/rdl/after> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                     owl:equivalentProperty <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#after> ;
                                                     rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/lis14/rdl/occursRelativeTo> ;
                                                     owl:inverseOf <http://rds.posccaesar.org/ontology/lis14/rdl/before> ;
